# Let's configure some nginx instances SUSE style

follow pillar.example

## Required salt master config:

```
file_roots:
  base:
    - {{ salt_base_dir }}/salt
    - {{ formulas_base_dir }}/nginx/
```

## cfgmgmt-template integration

if you are using our [cfgmgmt-template](https://codeberg.org/salted-geeko/cfgmgmt-template) as a starting point the saltmaster you can simplify the setup with:

```
git submodule add https://codeberg.org/salted-geeko/nginx-formula formulas/nginx
ln -s /srv/cfgmgmt/formulas/nginx/config/enable_nginx.conf /etc/salt/master.d/
systemctl restart salt-master.service
```

